#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
================================================================================
  CanSat 2027 Ground Control Station — Team 1059 — core (no UI)
  Container (1059C) + PocketQube (1059P), dual-band parallel telemetry
================================================================================
  Origin: GCS2027.py (Tkinter). The constants, parsing helpers, LinkReader,
  LinkManager, VirtualPayload, SimpProfileSender, ApogeeTracker and
  pq_state_from_packet below are copied unchanged from that file.
  GroundStation (at the bottom) is the non-UI half of the old GCSApp; main.py
  serves it to browsers over FastAPI + WebSockets.
================================================================================
  The two radios are co-equal parallel links (900 MHz + 2.4 GHz) — no primary/backup.
  The operator chooses which link to *view* (XBee / ESPNOW / Merged), but
  **uplink commands still go out on the single selected link only** to avoid double execution.
================================================================================
"""
